{"id":"c22e6fdd-3ab5-43a9-9e2c-8f57a9f7b3b8","object":"chat.completion","created":1793332175,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"The note text must be a single contiguous string literal.\n\n```python\nr = write_note(\n    title=\"multi_agent\",\n    content=\"多智能体（pp.38–40, 47–48）：ChatEval 让多个辩论者 agent 以不同角色和通信策略改进文本评估；AutoGen 以 agent 对话为编程范式；AgentVerse 四阶段（招募、协作决策、执行、评估迭代）；AgentSociety 超 10,000 agent。CAMEL 用 inception prompting 让角色保持身份并合作（p.45）。Generative Agents：模拟小镇 25 个 LLM agent（GPT-3.5），有 persona、记忆、反思与计划。可信度评估 p.47 原文：\\\"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\\\" 评估者按记忆、计划、反应、反思四类排序可信度，全架构最佳。答案 camel_prompting=inception_prompting；generative_agents_evaluators=100。延伸（p.47–48）：Park et al. 2024 用 1052 人标准化访谈建 1052 个 agent 复现态度，GSS 复现率 85%；集体行为研究涵盖合作涌现、信息传播、社会困境；新训练数据部分指出 GRPO/RLVR 已可用推理期 CoT 微调，开放多智能体模拟或为稳定 RL 提供探索多样性。\",\n    evidence_ids=[\"ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886\", \"ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495\"],\n    section=\"multi_agent\"\n)\nprint(r[\"note_id\"], r[\"chars\"])\n```","reasoning_content":"The note must be one string literal. Let me rewrite with a single contiguous string."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8962,"completion_tokens":391,"total_tokens":9353,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4224},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":17},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4224,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4738},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}